{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to your first semester at the Witch Academy!<br><br><br>Your task: Discover magical creatures \u2014 and complete the enchanted lexicon with everything you find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s an old legend\u2026<br><br>Deep within the enchanted forest, a mystical creature is said to dwell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perhaps you are the chosen one. The one who will witness it \u2014 or even tame it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your own magical garden. Nurture it with care \u2014 and let it bloom to attract the wild and wondrous beasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey begins now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant different flowers to attract the wildlife to your garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756550/extras/7053e81af023b5429eb79f4bb146e194.avif?t=1754922799\" width=1440 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed the animals to keep them happy, active and in the garden.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756550/extras/721aab6e72803ed654e632b09baed187.avif?t=1754922799\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take pictures and share them with your friends to see who managed to finish their project first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756550/extras/54ad396e5587d27b08aaac4f53a56ed4.avif?t=1754922799\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756550/extras_big/54ad396e5587d27b08aaac4f53a56ed4.avif?t=1754922799 width=1600 height=1000 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tiny surprise ending if you can tame all of the animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good Luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project was created by following SAE Zurich Students:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creature Artist</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lara Stolz</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environment Artist</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tamryn Lazenby</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Animation / Rigging</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lia Sennhauser</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Programming</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enna Zubler, Alexander Hofer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Special thanks to following people:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jo\u00eblle Salom\u00e9 G\u00f6tz</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Artwork</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adrian Hofer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Testers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peter Fl\u00fcck, Pascal Str\u00e4hl, Luca W\u00fcest, Lukas Hofer, Adrian Hofer, Ben Weber, Silas Br\u00fcellhardt,\u00a0Ivo Gon\u00e7alves</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3756550?t=1754922799","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3756550?t=1754922799","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756550/7fb6